---
/* REF: MG-2026-ASTRO-EN-HOW-WORK-01 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "How We Work / Methodology";
const pageDesc = "Mentor Group’s strategic methodology, incorporating intake scoping, dossier construction, sovereign liaison, and post-grant audit clearance.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDesc}>
  
  <section class="py-xl">
    <div class="ledger-container">
      
      <div class="dossier-box">
        <div class="dossier-header-bar">
          <span class="ref-stamp">REF: MG-2026-EN-HOWWORK</span>
          <span class="classification-stamp">[ OPERATIONAL PROSPECTUS / WORK PROCESS ]</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-title-box">
          <span class="sec-number">04. METHODOLOGY & ENGAGEMENT</span>
          <h1 class="hero-main-title">Statutory Scoping & Engagement Standards</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Emerging market entry and incentive scoping are exact sciences. We manage all corporate dossiers through four precise administrative phases.</p>
          <hr class="double-rule" />
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Steps detailed list in printed card style -->
        <div class="process-timeline-wrapper">
          
          <!-- Stage 1 -->
          <div class="timeline-card" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-line-muted); padding: var(--space-lg); background-color: var(--color-bg-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            <div class="flex justify-between align-center mb-xs">
              <span class="sec-number" style="color: var(--color-primary-green); font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">PHASE 01</span>
              <span class="ref-stamp">DIAGNOSIS & ACCEPTANCE</span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">Case Intake & Preliminary Dossier Scoping</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
              All client engagements begin with our paid "Initial Advisory Session". During this 30-minute consultation, our managing partner reviews your submitted dossier parameters. We establish the statutory baseline (such as Region 1-6 incentive eligibility or LLC/JSC capital matching), identify cross-border tax hurdles, scope partner requirements, and outline a structured roadmap.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Stage 2 -->
          <div class="timeline-card" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-line-muted); padding: var(--space-lg); background-color: var(--color-bg-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            <div class="flex justify-between align-center mb-xs">
              <span class="sec-number" style="color: var(--color-primary-green); font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">PHASE 02</span>
              <span class="ref-stamp">DOSSIER AUDIT & COMPILATION</span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">Filing Preparation & Regulatory Matching</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
              Upon formal engagement, we compile all required tech briefs, machinery projections, capital plans, and corporate bylaws. We verify that all parameters satisfy E-TUYS parameters, customs rules, and Chamber of Commerce regulations, maintaining a strict zero-friction objective for sovereign submissions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Stage 3 -->
          <div class="timeline-card" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-line-muted); padding: var(--space-lg); background-color: var(--color-bg-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            <div class="flex justify-between align-center mb-xs">
              <span class="sec-number" style="color: var(--color-primary-green); font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">PHASE 03</span>
              <span class="ref-stamp">SOVEREIGN LIAISON</span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">Ministry Submission & Process Coordination</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
              We submit the finalized files and act as your official executive liaison nezdinde. We directly manage procedural follow-ups with the Ministry of Industry and Technology, Chamber of Commerce, municipal licensing boards, and trade registers. We draft immediate responses to administrative queries, securing clean approvals.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Stage 4 -->
          <div class="timeline-card" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-line-muted); padding: var(--space-lg); background-color: var(--color-bg-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            <div class="flex justify-between align-center mb-xs">
              <span class="sec-number" style="color: var(--color-primary-green); font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem;">PHASE 04</span>
              <span class="ref-stamp">CLOSE-OUT & COMPLIANCE</span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">Post-Grant Auditing & Completion Clearance</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
              Once your entity is registered or the incentive certificate is granted, we provide continuous audit tracking. We coordinate machinery import close-outs, manage formal Ministry inspections on-site, secure the final Completion Visa, and oversee annual statutory compliance filings to ensure your investment remains fully secured.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="double-rule" style="margin: 25px 0;"></div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 25px;">
          <a href="/en/advisory/" class="btn btn-primary">BOOK INITIAL ADVISORY SESSION</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
